## Status Conditions

| Condition | Set by | When |
|---|---|---|
| `InsufficientPrivileges` | Provider reconciler (`ValidateVSpherePrivileges`) | vCenter service account missing migration privileges (after collector check completes) |
| VM concerns | OPA policy agent via `VMEventHandler` | Stored on VM model `concerns[]`, not a Provider condition |

