## Configuration

| Setting | Source | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Provider `spec.url` | Provider CR | vCenter or ESXi URL |
| Provider `spec.settings["sdkEndpoint"]` | Provider CR | `vCenter` or `ESXI` — validated against actual server type |
