## Error Patterns

| Scenario | Behavior |
|---|---|
| Connection failure | Collector retries every 5s; Provider → `ConnectionFailed` |
| PropertyCollector error (non-cancel) | Returns error, reconnect loop |
| Tx commit failure | Rolls back; `resetCustomFieldDefs()` clears stale cache |
| Tag fetch failure | Logged; VM update proceeds without tag refresh |
| Privilege check failure | Logged; cached result unchanged |
| Policy validation failure | Logged; picked up on next scheduled search |
| ESXi datastore ID with `host:/path` | Sanitized before insert |

