## Frontend Relevance

1. **Templates filtered** from VM list — do not expect `isTemplate=true` VMs in list responses
2. **Ghost VMs filtered** — incomplete inventory entries never appear in list
3. **Concerns** drive migration readiness warnings; from OPA, not inline validation
4. **`InsufficientPrivileges`** Provider condition (Warn) — show suggestion text; only on vCenter
5. **Network variant** (`Standard`, `DvPortGroup`, `OpaqueNetwork`, `DvSwitch`) controls display and extra fields (`dvSwitch`, `key`, `tag`, `vlanId`)
6. **`detail=1`** for table views; **`detail=2+`** for detail panels / disk selection
7. **Shared disks** (`disk.shared=true`) — flag or exclude in UI; concern `vmware.disk.shared.detected`
8. **Per-disk CBT** (`disk.changeTrackingEnabled`) — warm migration eligibility; keyed by `busAddress`
9. **`customValues[]`** on VM — references `customfielddefs` by numeric `key`
10. **`tags[]`** on VM — vCenter tag name/ID/category; vCenter only
11. **`consolidationNeeded`** — snapshot consolidation state from vSphere runtime
12. **`toolsVersionStatus2`** JSON key maps to Go field `ToolsVersionStatus`
13. **`guestNameFromVmwareTools`** preferred over `guestName` when available
14. **Tree endpoints** for folder/host pickers in plan wizard
15. **VDDK flow** — upload tar → watch build → read image URL; OpenShift clusters only
16. **Disk `busAddress`** — used by `RemoveExcludedDisks()` in policy workload (exclude by bus address)
